        "id": "AIXEM-REQ-AGENT-AUTHORING-0002",
        "level": "must",
        "text": "**MUST.** Each child route in a composite authoring task MUST remain within the configured seven-document, ninety-six-KiB, depth-three retrieval budget."
      },
